# Recommendation V2 replay. An export is pseudonymous, not anonymous; run.mjs refuses one inside
# the repository anyway, and these catch a copy or a report saved here by mistake. Kept in this
# folder, not the root .gitignore: the root file is an input to the Expo runtime fingerprint.
out/
*.export.json
replay-export*.json
rec-v2-replay-export*.json
replay*.md
!README.md
